Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 20:29:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] pgalloc: support copy-on-write shared base mappings

Allow a MemoryFile to overlay an immutable shared base with MAP_PRIVATE mappings. ExportLinearBase captures the committed memory image, and writes remain private to each MemoryFile.

Add coverage for shared reads, copy-on-write isolation, base export, and applying private deltas over a shared base.
